        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Email Enquiries Only\r\nAn exceptionally spacious and well-proportioned south-facing three-bedroom duplex extending to approximately 121 sq. m., ideally positioned in a quiet residential setting on Belarmine Way, Stepaside. The property is unfurnished and benefits from a private garden, generous living accommodation and excellent transport links.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hall with a large walk-in storage cupboard and guest WC, a separate living room to the front, and an impressive kitchen/dining/living area to the rear. This bright and versatile space features a second storage cupboard and French doors opening directly onto the enclosed south-facing garden.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are two large double bedrooms, both with fitted wardrobes, together with a spacious single bedroom, also with fitted wardrobes. The accommodation is completed by a family bathroom, an ensuite shower room, and an airing cupboard.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from gas-fired central heating, a B2 BER rating and parking. The M50 is approximately a five-minute drive away, while the Green Line LUAS at Glencairn is approximately a 17-minute walk. The 47-bus route also serves the area, providing convenient access to Dublin city and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nA spacious and practical home in a popular residential location, offering excellent accommodation and convenient access to Stepaside, Sandyford and Dublin's southside.\r\n\r\nEmail enquiries only. Please include full details with your enquiry. Due to the high level of interest, it may not be possible to respond to all enquiries."
